# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. A re-created leaf takes a write before its birth
# seed has landed, so nothing holds the floor for it once an orphan sweep has
# retired the surviving entry.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedWriteBeforeSeed
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a leaf takes a write before its birth block pin is seeded
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
Write ==
    /\ phase = "live"
    /\ seeded
--- REPLACE
Write ==
    /\ phase = "live"
\* MUTATION: the birth seed does not gate the first write.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
